    "long_instructions": "# Final App Polish\r\n\r\nUse Web Lab to review and finalize the version of your app you are ready to share.\r\n\r\nThis level is about choosing a version of your app that reflects the decisions you want to stand behind. Make final adjustments if they improve clarity, reliability, usability, or correctness — but you are not required to add new features.\r\n\r\nAs you work here:\r\n- Review how your app behaves in the situations you care most about.\r\n- Fix any issues that would make the app confusing, misleading, or unreliable for users.\r\n- Make small adjustments that improve clarity, trust, or usability.\r\n- Decide when your app is ready to be shared and explained to an audience.\r\n\r\nBefore you finish, open `capstone.md` and make sure all sections are complete. Your Final Reflection will draw on what you documented here.\r\n\r\n**Don't forget** to use AI Tutor to help you understand or debug code as needed.\r\n\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use Web Lab to review and finalize the version of your app you are ready to share. This should reflect the decisions you are standing behind at this point in the project. ***(supports completing Milestone 5)***.",
